  "scope": "For a norm-two real Coxeter normal acute to all four norm-two H4 simple roots, either all four pairings vanish or at least one has magnitude at least one. The positive inverse makes its H4 projection square at least 3+sqrt(5)>2. The five-wall Gram cannot be positive semidefinite, and its perpendicular component is timelike. Hence any wall meeting the whole H4 face must be orthogonal to H4. Includes every finite angle label, parallel and dotted relations. Does not exclude caps away from the face or any compact H9 completion."
